=== Mob Drops ===
{{Drop Sources}}

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|type = Chestplate
|name = Obsidian Chestplate
|rarity = epic

|defense = 250

|special_effect = While worn, gain {{Stat|speed|+1}} for every {{Green|20}} pieces of [[Obsidian]] in your inventory!<br>Immune to Wither effect.
}}
The item effect does not count obsidian located in the player's [[Storage]] or [[Mining Sack]].
It can also be [[salvaged]] for {{Green|3}} {{Item|Dragon Essence}}

== Trivia ==
*The maximum additional {{stat|spd}} that can be given to a player through the '''Obsidian Chestplate's''' ability is {{stat|spd|+112}} (with {{Green|35}} x {{Green|64}} = {{Item|Obsidian|amount=2240|link=}} or {{Item|Enchanted Obsidian|amount=2240|link=}} in their inventory.)
*The Obsidian Chestplate is one of 9 armor pieces which have the darkest color with a hex color code of {{Color Display|#000000}}. The others are {{Item|Bat Person Armor}}, {{Item|Squid Boots}}, {{Item|Tarantula Armor}}, {{Item|Shadow Assassin Armor}}, {{Item|Rancher's Boots}}, {{Item|Necromancer Lord Chestplate}}, {{Item|Snorkeling Armor}} and {{Item|Wither Armor}}.

